# Agreement between the European Community and the Swiss Confederation on certain aspects of government procurement.

This scope tracks the key dates associated with the agreement's entry into force.
```catala
declaration scope ProcurementAgreement:
  input signing_date content date
  output effective_date content date
```
The agreement enters into force on the date of signing.
```catala
scope ProcurementAgreement:
  date round down
  definition effective_date equals signing_date
```